          "heading": "Truthmaking as Grounding",
          "content": "The strict-order source argues that truthmaking and alethic-fact grounding are grounding relations, then uses self-truthmaking, self-grounding truth facts, mutual truthmaking, and non-transitive truthmaking chains to challenge strict-order constraints."
        },
        {
          "heading": "Synthesis Question",
